   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Wadi Bani Khalid in Oman. By many pronounced as the most beautiful wadi in Oman. The wadi has many lush green areas as well as an exciting canyon. The place is a really green oasis in the middle of a desert. The wadi is an important source of water in the otherwise ry surroundings</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
